---
import ReferenceLayout from '../layouts/ReferenceLayout.astro';
import { href } from '../lib/url';
---
<ReferenceLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="RadMage Finance provides general educational information, not financial, investment, tax or legal advice. Calculator results are estimates and simulations are teaching models."
  lead="RadMage Finance provides general educational information. It is not financial, investment, tax, legal or accounting advice."
  updated="2026-11-15"
>
  <h2>Education, not advice</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing on this site is a recommendation to buy, sell or hold any financial product or
    asset, or to choose any bank, lender or provider. The information is general and does not
    account for your circumstances. For decisions about your own finances, consider speaking
    with a qualified professional.
  </p>

  <h2>Calculator results are estimates</h2>
  <p>
    Results depend on the numbers you enter and on the assumptions each calculator states.
    Actual amounts from a bank or lender can differ because of rounding, timing, fees, rate
    changes and the terms of your agreement. Your institution's disclosures and agreements
    govern your actual account or loan.
  </p>

  <h2>Simulations are models</h2>
  <p>
    Lessons use simplified models to show how financial mechanisms work. They are not
    predictions about the economy, markets, interest rates or prices.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy</h2>
  <p>
    Facts are checked against their sources and dated, but errors are possible and
    information can go out of date. If you find a mistake, please report it on
    the <a href={href('corrections/')}>Corrections</a> page.
  </p>

  <h2>Independence and links</h2>
  <p>
    RadMage Finance is not affiliated with the Federal Reserve, any government agency, or any
    bank or financial institution. Mentioning a company, product or source is not an
    endorsement. Links to other websites are provided for reference, and those sites are
    responsible for their own content.
  </p>
</ReferenceLayout>
